{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyOX0pZ6EVRoHVPZsPjQHxa9"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Assignment Day 6 by Annisa DSML 43"],"metadata":{"id":"djdjgDbuBMy8"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Soal 1: Membuat Class dan Object\n","Buatlah class dan object dengan ketentuan sebagai berikut:\n","* Sebuah class bernama Mahasiswa\n","* Tambahkan tiga atribut di dalam class tersebut, yaitu: nama, nim, dan jurusan.\n","* Buatlah sebuah method/function bernama info_mahasiswa yang berfungsi untuk menampilkan informasi mahasiswa (nama, nim, dan jurusan).\n"],"metadata":{"id":"5f9-w4ZRBPt_"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"UAnjs3VlA89i","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1783337815131,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":14,"user":{"displayName":"ans 98","userId":"06343383610562038992"}},"outputId":"3e9efa0b-e240-4e2b-9fe2-ef8a83a8f90a"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Nama: April, NIM: 01234, Jurusan: Teknik Informatika\n"]}],"source":["#answer\n","\n","class Mahasiswa:\n","  def __init__(self, nama, nim, jurusan):\n","    self.nama = nama\n","    self.nim = nim\n","    self.jurusan = jurusan\n","\n","  def info_mahasiswa(self):\n","    return f\"Nama: {self.nama}, NIM: {self.nim}, Jurusan: {self.jurusan}\"\n","\n","mahasiswa_april = Mahasiswa('April','01234','Teknik Informatika')\n","\n","print(mahasiswa_april.info_mahasiswa())"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Soal 2: Mengimplementasikan Encapsulation\n","\n","* Buatlah sebuah class bernama Tabungan.\n","* Tambahkan sebuah atribut saldo yang bersifat private di dalam class tersebut.\n","* Buatlah method deposit yang berfungsi menambah saldo sesuai jumlah yang diberikan.\n","* Buatlah method tarik untuk mengurangi saldo.\n","* Berikan pengecekan di dalam metode tarik sehingga:\n","  1. Jika saldo tidak mencukupi, tampilkan pesan: \"Saldo tidak mencukupi.\"\n","  2. Jika saldo mencukupi, proses pengurangan saldo dapat dilakukan.\n","* Ujilah class yang kamu buat dengan membuat minimal satu object Tabungan, kemudian panggil metode deposit dan tarik untuk melihat apakah fungsinya berjalan sesuai ketentuan.\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"Q2CWWRrPGl8D"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["#answer\n","\n","class Tabungan:\n","\n","  def __init__(self, saldo):\n","    self.__saldo = saldo #private\n","\n","  def deposit(self, jumlah):\n","    if jumlah > 0:\n","      self.__saldo += jumlah\n","      return f\"deposit sebesar {jumlah} berhasil\"\n","    return \"Jumlah deposit tidak valid\"\n","\n","  def tarik(self, jumlah):\n","    if self.__saldo < jumlah:\n","      return(\"Saldo tidak mencukupi.\")\n","    if jumlah > 0:\n","      self.__saldo -= jumlah\n","      return f'tarik sebesar {jumlah} berhasil'\n","    return \"Jumlah tarik tidak valid\"\n","\n","  # method untuk cek saldo\n","  def get_saldo(self):\n","    return self.__saldo\n","\n","# membuat object baru\n","tabungan1 = Tabungan(1000)\n","print(f\"saldo awal : {tabungan1.get_saldo()}\")\n","\n","# memanggil method deposit\n","print(tabungan1.deposit(200))\n","print(f'saldo setelah deposit = {tabungan1.get_saldo()}')\n","\n","# memanggil method tarik\n","print(tabungan1.tarik(2000))\n","print(f'saldo setelah tarik pertama = {tabungan1.get_saldo()}')\n","\n","# memanggil method tarik\n","print(tabungan1.tarik(1000))\n","print(f'saldo setelah tarik kedua = {tabungan1.get_saldo()}')\n"],"metadata":{"id":"5bFsjKW2BNSe","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1783338008276,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":22,"user":{"displayName":"ans 98","userId":"06343383610562038992"}},"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"outputId":"ab2789d3-ca46-4b69-d97a-9f890da0ee1b"},"execution_count":3,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["saldo awal : 1000\n","deposit sebesar 200 berhasil\n","saldo setelah deposit = 1200\n","Saldo tidak mencukupi.\n","saldo setelah tarik pertama = 1200\n","tarik sebesar 1000 berhasil\n","saldo setelah tarik kedua = 200\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Soal 3: Mengimplementasikan Inheritance\n","* Buatlah sebuah class bernama Pegawai.\n","* Tambahkan dua atribut di dalam class Pegawai, yaitu: nama dan gaji.\n","* Buatlah sebuah subclass bernama Manager yang mewarisi class Pegawai.\n","* Tambahkan sebuah atribut baru pada class Manager, yaitu tunjangan.\n","* Buatlah metode info_manager pada class Manager yang berfungsi menampilkan  informasi nama, gaji, dan tunjangan dari instance Manager.\n","* Pastikan subclass Manager dapat mengakses atribut yang berasal dari class induk (Pegawai).\n","* Ujilah class Manager dengan membuat minimal satu instance Manager, kemudian panggil metode info_manager.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"645O63koRzLW"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["class Pegawai:\n","  def __init__ (self,nama,gaji):\n","    self.nama = nama\n","    self.gaji = gaji\n","\n","  def info(self):\n","    return f\"Nama: {self.nama}, gaji: {self.gaji}\"\n","\n","class Manager(Pegawai):\n","  def __init__ (self,nama,gaji,tunjangan):\n","    super().__init__(nama, gaji)\n","    self.tunjangan = tunjangan\n","\n","  def info_manager(self):\n","    return f'Nama: {self.nama}, Gaji: {self.gaji}, Tunjangan: {self.tunjangan}'\n","\n","# buat object baru\n","manager = Manager('Riko','25.000.000','5.000.000')\n","\n","# panggil metode info_manager\n","print(manager.info_manager())\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"YnvWyULKz5M3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1783316816086,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":25,"user":{"displayName":"ans 98","userId":"06343383610562038992"}},"outputId":"f2ea9526-c23f-4e39-e1da-f4e4ad2444cb"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Nama: Riko, Gaji: 25.000.000, Tunjangan: 5.000.000\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Soal 4: Polymorphism dan Method Overriding\n","* Buatlah sebuah class bernama Kendaraan.\n","* Tambahkan sebuah method bernama bahan_bakar di dalam class Kendaraan yang hanya menampilkan pesan:\n"," \"Jenis bahan bakar tidak diketahui.\"\n","* Buatlah subclass bernama Mobil yang mewarisi class Kendaraan.\n","* Buatlah subclass bernama Motor yang juga mewarisi class Kendaraan.\n","* Override method bahan_bakar pada class Mobil sehingga menampilkan jenis bahan bakar yang digunakan (misalnya \"Bensin\").\n","* Override method bahan_bakar pada class Motor untuk menampilkan jenis bahan bakarnya (misalnya \"Solar\", atau sesuai arahan soal).\n","* Ujilah ketiga class tersebut dengan membuat instance dari Kendaraan, Mobil, dan Motor, kemudian panggil method bahan_bakar pada masing-masing object untuk melihat perbedaannya.\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"J65QCX-Pbkb_"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["#answer\n","\n","class Kendaraan:\n","  def bahan_bakar(self):\n","    return f\"Jenis bahan bakar tidak diketahui.\"\n","\n","class Mobil(Kendaraan):\n","  def bahan_bakar(self):\n","    return f'Mobil menggunakan bahan bakar bensin'\n","\n","class Motor(Kendaraan):\n","  def bahan_bakar(self):\n","    return f'Motor menggunakan bahan bakar solar'\n","\n","# membuat instance\n","kendaraan = Kendaraan()\n","mobil = Mobil()\n","motor = Motor()\n","\n","# panggil method bahan_bakar\n","print(kendaraan.bahan_bakar())\n","print(mobil.bahan_bakar())\n","print(motor.bahan_bakar())\n","\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"UnhNrAHJb6QE","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1783338097956,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":17,"user":{"displayName":"ans 98","userId":"06343383610562038992"}},"outputId":"458566a2-36cb-4536-d8a4-83fccf3f5234"},"execution_count":4,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Jenis bahan bakar tidak diketahui.\n","Mobil menggunakan bahan bakar bensin\n","Motor menggunakan bahan bakar solar\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Soal 5: Abstraction dan Interfaces\n","* Buatlah sebuah class abstrak bernama Hewan.\n","* Tambahkan sebuah method abstrak bernama suara di dalam class Hewan.\n","Notes: Method ini harus dideklarasikan sebagai abstrak, tanpa implementasi.\n","* Buatlah dua buah subclass bernama Kucing dan Anjing yang mewarisi class Hewan.\n","* Implementasikan method suara pada class Kucing dan Anjing sehingga menghasilkan suara khas hewan tersebut (contoh: \"Meow\" untuk kucing, “Bark” untuk anjing).\n","* Ujilah kedua subclass dengan membuat instance dari Kucing dan Anjing, lalu panggil method suara untuk memastikan implementasi berjalan sesuai ketentuan.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"fQlRcyyVjcAi"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n","\n","class Hewan(ABC):\n","\n","  @abstractmethod\n","  def suara (self):\n","    pass\n","\n","class Kucing(Hewan):\n","  def suara (self):\n","    return f'Meow'\n","\n","class Anjing(Hewan):\n","  def suara (self):\n","    return f'Bark'\n","\n","kucing = Kucing()\n","anjing = Anjing()\n","\n","print(f'suara kucing adalah {kucing.suara()}')\n","print(f'suara anjing adalah {anjing.suara()}')"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"fGYP-TQgepwA","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1783316823736,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":4,"user":{"displayName":"ans 98","userId":"06343383610562038992"}},"outputId":"13d3febf-b131-4d33-8262-d6d798781107"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["suara kucing adalah Meow\n","suara anjing adalah Bark\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Reflection Question\n","\n","Setelah menyelesaikan assignment  ini, jelaskan dengan bahasa Anda sendiri:\n","\n","1. Setelah mengerjakan seluruh latihan OOP ini, bagian mana dari konsep OOP (encapsulation, inheritance, polymorphism, atau abstraction) yang paling membantu kamu memahami bagaimana program besar dapat dibuat lebih terstruktur? Jelaskan alasanmu.”\n","\n","* **answer**: menurut saya yang paling membantu saya adalah inheritance. karena class child pada inheritance mewarisi attribute dan method parent class dan juga bisa menambahkan attribute dan method baru sesuai kebutuhan, terlebih lagi bisa memakai \"super()\", jadi tidak perlu menulis ulang. saya lebih bisa memahami struktur OOP setelah mempelajari inheritance.\n","setelah saya memahami inheritance, saya lebih mudah memahami konsep lain seperti encapsulation, polymorphism, atau abstraction.\n","\n","\n","2. Dari pengalaman membuat class dan object hingga menerapkan konsep lanjutan seperti overriding dan class abstrak, apa perubahan cara pandangmu terhadap proses merancang sebuah program? Ceritakan bagaimana konsep OOP membuatmu berpikir lebih modular dan efisien.\n","* **answer**: konsep OOP ini membantu saya berpikir lebih modular karena setiap class punya tugas dan tanggup jawab sendiri. ini juga memudahkan saya menulis coding dengan cara berpikir yang terstruktur dan efisien karena beberapa kode bisa digunakan kembali melalui inheritance, dan method jg bisa disesuaikan lagi melalui overriding sesuai kebutuhan class turunannya.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"QEjxxAKD8v4K"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"xPf7Wftb6Vhq"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]}]}